        "brief": "You're covering the Care Laundry desk at Carrholme Services this morning. Some items are routine, some are requests or complaints that belong with the DPO, and one or two were made to trick you. For each one, choose Trust, Report, Delete or Verify (ring someone on a number you already hold), then tick what you noticed. Anything about someone's personal data, a request to see, correct or delete it, or a breach, goes to the DPO the same day. Reporting or checking when you're unsure is always fine and never marked down, though a real one does take a colleague's time to check.",
