            "body": "Hi,\nA spreadsheet has just landed in my inbox from your desk, 'Carrholme overtime, this month'. It's got nine of your staff on it, their hours, and a notes column with things like a hospital appointment and a back injury. I'm the manager here at Hollinsbrook House, so I don't think this was meant for me. I haven't opened it any further. Do you want me to delete it?\nSam Whitlow\nHollinsbrook House",
            "auth": {
              "spf": "pass",
              "dkim": "pass",
              "dmarc": "pass",
              "envelopeFrom": "hollinsbrookhouse.example",
              "replyTo": "sam.whitlow@hollinsbrookhouse.example"
            },
