              "flags": [],
              "whyFine": {
                "default": "Sam has flagged that your staff's overtime, with health notes, reached her by mistake. That is a personal data breach: report it the same way you would report anything, and say it involves personal data, so it reaches the DPO. Asking her to delete it is a good next step, not instead of reporting."
              }
            }
          },
